{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d9d14ec1786f5b2a346b22b91b066ecc4ece8ba003374cc76432b65ce8995ce4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e12f569139d6abb7cdbf8d5ec8823af026029d7dcbb7231dd7f08b17654ea6a",
      "text": "辛苦了，我是神乐。\n阁下现在在哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86e5e3c70f148c277f20717fd27cdaa6030a301364d07c11c9ed3181e42431f2",
      "text": "我在帐篷这里",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4b342aae074349805051d5b7a5cad7b9afe090f0b9dbad57781a19326ad4ac1",
      "text": "这样啊。\n你说过搭建完成后要休息一会儿来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df3086e26da690158aaee5cbb44b9b9e62a85e1cf659a8e5bc3c131eaee06704",
      "text": "要是有时间的话，要不要来小河这边看看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:257b5c351a0ade8e4c2c6144f79cbc63c1e7cd8db118bf03895a19053b1ed1e2",
      "text": "我刚才在这里稍微散了会儿步，\n这里的河水真的很清澈，空气也很舒服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0083220fd3a3d5fd6cf27379dff2af6d0c49e86ae561290cba7d145d163541ac",
      "text": "这一带视野也很开阔，充满开放感。\n一定能消除平日工作带来的疲惫吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbc138261ab046ff4cf8afb1940eaf18e9de4fa64e162852fa53fa45d0038012",
      "text": "听说还能吃到用河水冰镇过的蔬菜呢。\n西红柿、黄瓜……好像还准备了其他的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3993e1c878811bef93854044180271f0f7180859d567903fe9760a5128bd7a",
      "text": "听起来很好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e57c7ada758e38291a729fdeabc2c296c8757965fa9e3c60e9bb735cc646509c",
      "text": "我稍后就过去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74fc4db46543e3bd43cb90c72206b823759d7ba6b8258504d2e4ec6a2c2ae08d",
      "text": "我打算再欣赏一会儿这里的景色然后\n回去。要是能合流的话请联系我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_402_2_4_008_02_09_b:2_4_008_02_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c71c1a9cffd3a1f6dc751d0103103ad8749c540c2067ad0ecd44612a7de2cb9",
      "text": "由我来为你引路吧。\n那么，待会儿见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
